1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,552
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,552 --> 00:00:04,149
Let's learn kind words to say.

3
00:00:04,699 --> 00:00:07,124
Hello, everyone!

4
00:00:08,824 --> 00:00:11,674
We say hello when we see a friend.

5
00:00:12,174 --> 00:00:14,274
Can you say hello?

6
00:00:15,874 --> 00:00:17,973
Hello, Teddy!

7
00:00:18,523 --> 00:00:20,798
Hello, Mimzi!

8
00:00:22,498 --> 00:00:25,398
We say good morning when we wake up.

9
00:00:25,898 --> 00:00:28,198
Can you say good morning?

10
00:00:29,798 --> 00:00:32,472
Good morning, sunshine!

11
00:00:34,172 --> 00:00:37,072
We say please when we want something.

12
00:00:37,572 --> 00:00:39,722
Can you say please?

13
00:00:41,322 --> 00:00:44,172
Can I have a cookie, please?

14
00:00:45,872 --> 00:00:48,872
We say thank you when someone helps us.

15
00:00:49,372 --> 00:00:51,647
Can you say thank you?

16
00:00:53,247 --> 00:00:55,572
Thank you, Mimzi!

17
00:00:56,122 --> 00:00:58,548
You're welcome, Teddy!

18
00:01:00,248 --> 00:01:03,148
We say sorry when we make a mistake.

19
00:01:03,648 --> 00:01:05,798
Can you say sorry?

20
00:01:07,398 --> 00:01:10,023
Oops! I'm sorry, Teddy.

21
00:01:10,573 --> 00:01:12,698
That's okay!

22
00:01:14,398 --> 00:01:17,548
We say goodbye when a friend goes home.

23
00:01:18,048 --> 00:01:20,298
Can you say goodbye?

24
00:01:21,898 --> 00:01:23,406
Goodbye, Teddy!

25
00:01:23,406 --> 00:01:24,747
See you soon!

26
00:01:26,447 --> 00:01:29,047
We say good night at bedtime.

27
00:01:29,547 --> 00:01:31,747
Can you say good night?

28
00:01:33,347 --> 00:01:35,034
Good night, Teddy.

29
00:01:35,034 --> 00:01:36,321
Sweet dreams.

30
00:01:38,021 --> 00:01:40,346
Let's say them all together!

31
00:01:40,896 --> 00:01:42,917
Hello! Good morning!

32
00:01:42,917 --> 00:01:43,796
Please!

33
00:01:44,046 --> 00:01:45,230
Thank you!

34
00:01:45,230 --> 00:01:46,870
Sorry! Goodbye!

35
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,769
Good night!

36
00:01:50,519 --> 00:01:53,368
Now let's play a memory game!

37
00:01:53,918 --> 00:01:55,506
Do you remember?

38
00:01:55,506 --> 00:01:56,593
Let's see!

39
00:01:58,293 --> 00:02:00,168
What do we say?

40
00:02:02,368 --> 00:02:03,943
Hello!

41
00:02:04,493 --> 00:02:06,793
Yes! Well done!

42
00:02:08,493 --> 00:02:10,368
What do we say?

43
00:02:12,568 --> 00:02:14,392
Good morning!

44
00:02:14,942 --> 00:02:16,892
That's right!

45
00:02:18,592 --> 00:02:20,467
What do we say?

46
00:02:22,667 --> 00:02:24,166
Please

47
00:02:24,716 --> 00:02:26,741
Great job!

48
00:02:28,441 --> 00:02:30,316
What do we say?

49
00:02:32,516 --> 00:02:34,190
Thank you!

50
00:02:34,740 --> 00:02:36,715
You got it!

51
00:02:38,415 --> 00:02:40,290
What do we say?

52
00:02:42,490 --> 00:02:43,864
Sorry

53
00:02:44,414 --> 00:02:46,114
Super!

54
00:02:47,814 --> 00:02:49,689
What do we say?

55
00:02:51,889 --> 00:02:53,563
Goodbye!

56
00:02:54,113 --> 00:02:55,763
Hooray!

57
00:02:57,463 --> 00:02:59,338
What do we say?

58
00:03:01,538 --> 00:03:03,187
Good night!

59
00:03:03,737 --> 00:03:06,037
Yes! Well done!

60
00:03:07,737 --> 00:03:10,763
Wow! You remembered everything!

61
00:03:12,613 --> 00:03:15,263
You are a super learner!

62
00:03:16,963 --> 00:03:19,763
Great job, little learner!

63
00:03:20,313 --> 00:03:22,264
Share Mimzi with a friend,

64
00:03:22,264 --> 00:03:24,888
and subscribe for more learning fun!

65
00:03:25,438 --> 00:03:26,368
Next time,

66
00:03:26,368 --> 00:03:29,087
let's play find the missing letter.

67
00:03:29,337 --> 00:03:31,063
Bye bye!
